          border: Border.all(color: selected ? Colors.white24 : Colors.white10),
        ),
        child: Text(
          label,
          style: TextStyle(
            color: Colors.white.withOpacity(selected ? 1.0 : 0.78),
            fontSize: 11.5,
            fontWeight: FontWeight.w700,
          ),
        ),
      ),
    );
  }

